Package: rlazycartesian
Type: Package
Title: R Interface for Lazy Cartesian Products
Version: 0.3
Date: 2026-07-23
Author: Andrés Cruz
Maintainer: Andrés Cruz <andres.cruz@utexas.edu>
Description: Functions to lazily obtain elements from cartesian
    products, including random samples. Partial wrapper of the
    `lazy-cartesian-product` C++ library 
    (<https://github.com/tylerburdsall/lazy-cartesian-product>).
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: Rcpp (>= 1.0.12)
LinkingTo: Rcpp
URL: https://github.com/arcruz0/rlazycartesian
BugReports: https://github.com/arcruz0/rlazycartesian/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
